5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should start by examining the post-occupancy review ratings and the booking data for specialist and general rooms to see how our previous investments are actually performing.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Toshio. I would also like to look into the timetable records on rooms out of service and the post-occupancy review ratings to understand the impact of construction on our operations.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I'll focus on the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines to see how our personnel are coping.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I think it's important to look at the survey findings in the older blocks and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale to identify any recurring delays.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure our budget projections are realistic, I will examine the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have a broad range of data covered, I'm satisfied with these choices. I'll stick with the post-occupancy review ratings and the booking data.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am also content with the current distribution. I will proceed with the timetable records and the post-occupancy review ratings.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I see no reason to change my selection. I will remain with the staffing posts and the bench technicians' routines.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. I will proceed with the survey findings in the older blocks and the decade of delivery schedules.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I shall maintain my selection of the tender records and the renewal reserve. It seems we have a comprehensive approach for this round.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
